* Advanced Dynamic Testbench for LM324B
.include LM324B_iter2_probe_a.cir

* Power Supply Setup (VCC = 15V)
V_VCC_P VCC_P 0 15
V_VCC_N VCC_N 0 0

* DUT Instantiation
XDUT 1IN_P 1IN_N 1OUT 2IN_P 2IN_N 2OUT 3IN_P 3IN_N 3OUT 4IN_P 4IN_N 4OUT VCC_P VCC_N NC LM324B

* Input Stimulus for Channel 1 (Example based on provided constraints)
VINP 1IN_P 0 SINE(2.5 0.1 1k 10u)
VINN 1IN_N 0 DC 2.5

* Load Termination for Channel 1
RL 1OUT 0 10k

* Simulation Control (Must only use .tran)
.tran 10u 20m 10m

* Measurement Directives (Must use .meas tran)
.four 1k 9 V(1OUT)
.meas tran v_rms RMS V(1OUT) from=15m to=20m
.meas tran icc AVG -I(V_VCC_P) from=10m to=20m

.control
run
.endc
.end
